From 5dc09bdc9abc114774c132cc5d2070197502a1cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Chong <achong@meta.com>
Date: Mon, 18 Aug 2025 18:40:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 22/63] enable cellular on macos cuttlefish host tools

Summary:
# Motivation:
Cellular features are needed on mac hosts for wearable devices. This is used in cases like asking meta ai to place a phone call or asking meta ai to make a text. The phone paired with the wearable device must have cellular capabilities.
# Overview:
AF_UNIX sockets cannot be abstract on macOS -> sun_path starting with `"/0"`

https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man7/unix.7.html
